WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Your attention can miss something directly in front of you. That doesn't mean a sound file can fix it.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Zen12 is advertised as a library of twelve-minute listening sessions, with different styles and levels.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The product is real as an advertised format. Its one-hour-in-twelve-minutes benefit is a seller claim, not independently established here.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
An independent review found inconsistent EEG evidence for binaural-beat entrainment. It did not study Zen12.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying, try a free twelve-minute ritual three times and notice what kind of audio you actually prefer.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the evidence, check the data terms, and make your own decision. No purchase required.
